<title>SINGAPORE: NOL first half profit down 43 pct.</title>
<headline>NOL first half profit down 43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 10.18     vs    17.78</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    1.41     vs     2.53</p>
<p>    Turnover		  937.15     vs   927.61</p>
<p>    Other income		4.00     vs     4.92</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax	 6.48     vs    16.45</p>
<p>    Associates		  2.21     vs     2.15</p>
<p>    Tax			   1.82     vs     2.18</p>
<p>    Minorities		  3.32     vs     1.36</p>
<p>Note - Neptune Orient Lines Ltd (NOL) said results were affected by intense competition but expected second-half to be profitable.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
